'''Kuudra Archeologist''' is an [[NPC]] found on {{zone|Dragontail}}. They appear in {{zone|Dragontail}} after the [[player]] defeats [[Kuudra]] for the first time.

== Purpose ==
{{main|Kuudra Relic}}
The coordinates for the {{Item|Kuudra Relic}} can be obtained by entering a 2 and a 22, obtained from pulling out a book in the {{zone|Cathedral}}, into the equation given by '''Kuudra Archeologist'''.

Bringing '''Kuudra Archeologist''' a {{Item|Kuudra Relic}} will award the player with {{Item|Kuudra Follower Leggings}}.

